1. PROJECT OVERVIEW.

This report documents the reconnaissance and initial vulnerabilty scanning performed against Kioptrix vulnerable virtual machine.

The assessment was conducted using Kali Linux within a VirtualBox lab environment.

The objective was to discover the target, identify active network services examine exposed ports and investigate potential web server vulnerabilities.



2. LAB ENVIRONMENT

