4. INITIAL NMAP PORT SCANNING

Objective :

Identify open TCP ports and determine which network services were accessible on the target.

Command : nmap 10.0.2.6

The most default Nmap scan checks the most common TCP ports.

Scan Results:

The target was confirmed to be online.

Nmap reported:

-Host status Up

-Latency 0.0018 seconds

-Closed TCP ports: 994.


Open Ports Identified

